## Limitations

The project has some limitations:

- Increasing the number of locations and connections may increase the complexity of optimization.
- Some edge cases may not be fully covered by the implemented tests.

## Future Improvements

Possible improvements include:

- Increasing test coverage
- Improving scalability when the number of locations increases
- Optimizing the management of connections between locations
